# ============================================================================
# TRACKED — do NOT add to gitignore
# ============================================================================
# ProjectSettings/    — Unity project settings (tracked)
# Packages/           — Unity package manifest (tracked)
# levels/*.json       — Level definitions (tracked)
# scripts/*.py        — Build and tooling scripts (tracked)
# docs/               — All documentation (tracked)
# .github/            — CI/CD workflows (tracked)
# .cursor/            — Cursor AI rules and skills (tracked)
# config/             — Firebase and build config (tracked)


